# Hard stops

No live Stripe activation/charges/refunds/credits/payment links. No paid spend. No production deletion. No publication. No health/safety judgement. No first-client programme go-live. No material legal/privacy exception. No irreversible account/security changes.

# Fail-closed gates

- Test-mode payment cannot become live Closed Won
- Missing explicit health consent blocks screening/Ready
- Ready cannot bypass human evidence
- Programme assignment blocked without founder approval
- Publication blocked without exact-final dual PASS (taylorPass + chatgptPass on the same checksum/config)
- Duplicate event_id/idempotency key is ignored
- Cancellation refund/credit routes to founder

All connectors are dry-run. State transitions fail closed without required evidence.
